Text: We show that even by hiding the labels from the ML algo- rithm, we can recover 78.5% of the correct labels. The contributions of this paper can be summa- rized as follows: • We predict the political role of Internet trolls (left, news feed, right) in a realistic, unsuper- vised scenario, where labels for the trolls are not available, and which has not been explored in the literature before.

